<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Cek Karyawan - ICT Universitas</title>
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Poppins:wght@400;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <script>
        tailwind.config = {
            theme: {
                extend: {
                    colors: {
                        primary: '#e62129', // --red-500
                        border: '#d9d9d9',  // --gray-400
                        input: '#bfbfbf',   // --gray-500
                        muted: '#f5f5f5',   // --gray-200
                        'muted-foreground': '#8c8c8c', // --gray-600
                        foreground: '#262626', // --gray-800
                    },
                    fontFamily: {
                        sans: ['Poppins', 'sans-serif'], // font-family: Poppins
                    }
                }
            }
        }
    </script>
    <style>
        /* Typography Styles sesuai spesifikasi typography.tsx */
        .text-h3 { font-size: 36px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 46px; }
        .text-body-small { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 400; line-height: 22px; }
        .text-caption-bold { font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 20px; }
    </style>
</head>
<body class="bg-[#fafafa] font-sans min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center p-4">

    <div class="w-full max-w-md bg-white rounded-xl shadow-lg border border-border overflow-hidden">
        
        <div class="p-6 border-b border-border bg-gradient-to-b from-white to-[#ffeced]">
            <h1 class="text-h3 text-primary font-bold">ICT Universitas</h1>
            <p class="text-caption-bold text-muted-foreground uppercase tracking-widest mt-1">Sistem Distribusi Aset</p>
        </div>

        <div class="p-8">
            <div class="mb-8">
                <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-foreground">Verifikasi Pegawai</h2>
                <p class="text-body-small text-muted-foreground mt-2">Silakan masukkan NIP Anda untuk memeriksa status pengambilan inventaris laptop baru.</p>
            </div>

            <form action="/cek-karyawan" method="POST" class="space-y-6">
                
                <div class="flex flex-col gap-1.5">
                    <label class="text-sm font-medium text-foreground leading-[22px]">Nomor Induk Pegawai (NIP)</label>
                    <div class="flex h-10 w-full items-center overflow-hidden rounded-lg border border-input bg-white transition-colors focus-within:border-primary">
                        <input 
                            type="text" 
                            name="nip" 
                            placeholder="Masukkan NIP" 
                            required
                            class="px-3 py-2 text-sm h-full flex-1 bg-transparent outline-none placeholder:text-muted-foreground"
                        >
                    </div>
                    <span class="text-xs text-muted-foreground leading-5">Masukkan NIP tanpa spasi atau tanda baca.</span>
                </div>

                <button 
                    type="submit" 
                    class="h-10 w-full px-4 flex items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-primary text-white text-sm font-medium transition-all hover:bg-[#ef6c70] active:bg-[#a51217]"
                >
                    Cek Status
                </button>
            </form>
        </div>

        <div class="px-6 py-4 bg-muted border-t border-border flex justify-center items-center">
            <span class="text-[10px] font-bold text-muted-foreground uppercase tracking-tighter">ICT Division Technical Support</span>
        </div>
    </div>

</body>
</html>